Tue Sep 15 05:46:37 UTC 2026 - Kim DaeHyun <kernalix7@kodenet.io>

- Update to official version 3.2.0.
- Migrate from CMake to Meson while preserving all six subpackages
  and existing installed paths.
- Add 0001-meson-cargo-frozen.patch to build with frozen vendored
  Cargo dependencies; run kime-engine-core tests with --frozen.
- Remove obsolete Qt6 source-copy, IID and private-include workarounds
  now supplied by upstream Meson.
- Retain Qt5/Qt6 private-header build dependencies for automatic
  private-ABI dependency generation and rebuild tracking.

